   "length_m": 0.35,
   "radiation_corner_hz": 2498.2940779538876,
   "main_tailpipe_radiation_corner_hz": 839.8483920080015,
   "open_fraction_of_running": 0.8310432506231447,
   "why": "FIA 2025 Art. 5.9.2 mandates a separate wastegate exhaust of at most 1500 mm^2. Its gas has NOT been through the turbine, and its mouth is 43.7 mm equivalent diameter against the main tailpipe's 65 mm, so its radiation corner is 2493 Hz against 840 Hz. That is the physical origin of the brightness the deleted `rasp` was faking with a band of white noise at 300-2600 Hz."
  },
