   "why": "both were stationary noise beds standing in for facts that are modelled physically elsewhere -- cycle-to-cycle irregularity by the crank jitter and CYL_CHARGE, the overrun tone by the 0.38 pumping floor down the primaries -- and `rasp`'s band IS the client's complaint band"
  }
